<title>LATVIA: SOCCER-SCOTLAND, LATVIA DRAW 0-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCOTLAND, LATVIA DRAW 0-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia and Scotland drew 0-0 in their European Under-21 championship group four qualifer on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,000</p>
</text>
